  "details": "On the current beta branch small ramps such as the one in the home world at certain points cause the Grounded parameter state to flicker true and false every other frame. \nIt also applies a VelocityY at -0.08 and 0.08 at the same time.  \nThis causes rather strong issue with the locomotion layer.\nThe live branch [1174] does not have this issue in the exact same location. I used an avi showing the current location to nearly get an exact location between both versions.)\nVideo example: https://streamable.com/eciqnr\nThe top client being live and the bottom client being beta.",
